      "priority": 3,
      "category": "German-naturalness",
      "title": "Use a simpler idiomatic listening construction",
      "problem": "The German clause Ich habe bis zum Ende zugehört, was ... is awkward. A dative listener construction conveys the Korean naturally without changing the event or the younger-brother relation. This is a wording improvement, not a Korean sense error.",
