      "priority": 3,
      "category": "sense-disambiguation",
      "title": "Make the small-degree sense unambiguous",
      "problem": "창문을 좀 열어 주세요 is grammatical and can mean opening the window a little, but 좀 also commonly softens requests. The selected dictionary sense is small amount or degree. A non-request comparative sentence teaches that selected sense more clearly. The existing row is not an unambiguous translation error.",
